## permet de tester quel joueur est @s et de faire spawn le drapeau en fonction

execute at @s[team=blue,tag=!no_team] run summon armor_stand ~ ~ ~ {NoGravity:1b,Invulnerable:1b,Small:1b,Marker:1b,Invisible:1b,Tags:["rally_flag_model","blue_rally_flag"],DisabledSlots:4144959,equipment:{head:{id:"minecraft:blue_banner",count:1,components:{"minecraft:banner_patterns":[{"pattern":"minecraft:rhombus","color":"orange"},{"pattern":"minecraft:border","color":"orange"}]}}}}
